description.narrative:
SALAR as it was planned during the scoping mission managed:
- To understand the background and context within the area of decentralisation and
local self-governance in Georgia;
- To Identify pressing development needs, relevant stakeholders as well as possible
project requirements;
- To begin to identify the scope and demarcations and select the thematic tracks for
further investigation;
- and as a result to develop a proposal for an inception period, including methods and
activities and make an estimate of the need for skills and resources, and the time required
for realization;
